You can do something else meanwhile: this step will wait for you.

som.ctf.texte:
Three fragments, three skills (your mastered worlds: {mondes}):
1. ctf/registre.log: a precise regular expression;
2. ctf/eboulis/: a .frag hidden behind spaces;
3. ctf/porte.sh: a tool to learn with --help, which wants fragment 1 as its key.
The flag: TG{fragment1-fragment2-fragment3}. The clock is running!
